<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Mesirow starts Magna Group.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Mesirow starts Magna Group.</headline>
<text>
<p>- Mesirow Financial on Friday said it initiated coverage of Magna Group Inc, recommending purchase at the stock's current price.</p>
<p>- Analyst Rick Jacobus said he based his rating on the company's good fundamental financial position, attractive earnings outlook and comparatively low stock price.</p>
<p>- Jacobus said Magna is expected to achieve double-digit earnings growth over the next few years.</p>
<p>- Magna shares were up 5/8 at 25-3/8.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
